+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items for duplicate references and arithmetic mismatches, then returns findings to a human finance operator.
+
+## Operating boundary
+
+The service never authorizes or sends payment.
+
+## Implementation evidence
+
+`src/invoice-review.ts` currently implements deterministic duplicate-reference detection. The inspected source does not establish arithmetic-mismatch detection behavior or an interface for it, so that runtime behavior is not asserted here.
